{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Status update — core fix MERGED; guard-hardening follow-up in review\n\n**Merged.** The operator-mandated single-choke-point AST guard + the full\n49-site sweep landed via Gerrit **2358**, auto-submitted (rebased) as commit\n`3642db3b9b21` once it earned `LLM-Review +1` AND `Verified +1` with no\nunresolved comments. Combined with the previously-merged **2347**\n(`1504d096ceca`), the defect is fully remediated on `main`: every CLI\n`--output json` store-data emitter now routes through `js_safe_dumps`, and the\nguard fails `make lint` if a future emitter reintroduces a bare bigint.\n\n**Follow-up in review — Gerrit 2364.** PS2 of 2358 drew four *non-blocking*\nadvisory LLM-Review findings; the change auto-submitted before I could fold\nthem in, so they are addressed in a small follow-up (same ticket trailer):\n- **Correctness (false positive):** the guard flagged any `print(...)` as a\n  stdout sink, including `print(json.dumps(diag), file=sys.stderr)` — a stderr\n  diagnostic the guard's own docstring permits. Now honours the `file=` keyword.\n- **Docstring accuracy:** corrected a stale \"LLM-eval tooling out of scope\" note\n  (`_llm_eval_commands.py` is under a scan root and IS covered).\n- **Tests:** added a negative scoping test (a raw `print(json.dumps())` in\n  `_logging` / the reconciler daemon / an unrelated module is NOT flagged) and\n  pinned the exit-code contract (`main()` returns 1 on a violation, 0 clean).\n\nGuard self-tests now 28 passed; `make lint` / `make typecheck` / complexity\n(new=0) all green locally. Will report on merge, then close the ticket with\n`--class=preexisting` (contract evolution; no `--caused-by`)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787969885554970001,"uuid":"e682a44f-b36c-40ac-954e-bc73cb0417e2"}